      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1394704228,
          "type": null,
          "body": "tools/check_typed_item_calls.py was only checking the length against item size for proto_tree_add_item(), whereas this is proto_tree_add_item_ret_uint().  When I add that in, I could detect these errors, and also:\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-uds.c:2891 proto_tree_add_item_ret_uint called for hf_uds_rft_file_size_or_dir_info_param_length  -  item type is FT_UINT8 but call has len 2",
